      "source": [
        "# Profit vs Fairness in Automated Loan Approval\n",
        "\n",
        "### German Credit Dataset Analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Problem statement\n",
        "\n",
        "This project analyzes an automated loan approval system with two competing objectives:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Profit Objective:** Accurately approve applicants who are likely to repay loans.\n",
        "- **Fairness Risk:** Avoid systematically disadvantaging certain demographic or socioeconomic groups\n",
        "\n",
        "The goal is to evaluate whether the system introduces bias while optimizing for financial performance.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Dataset Overview\n",
        "\n",
        "The dataset used in the German Credit dataset, which contains applicant financial and personal information.\n",
        "\n",
        "Two versions are used:\n",
        "\n",
        "- `german.data` (categorical + numerical)\n",
        "- `german.data-numeric` (fully numeric, used for modeling)\n",
        "\n",
        "Since the numeric dataset uses encoded values, a data dictionary is required to interpret the features.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Data Dictionary (Partial)\n",
        "\n",
        "### Financial Attributes - Part 1\n",
        "\n",
        "| Attribute | Type | Description | Codes |\n",
        "|-----------|------|-------------|-------|\n",
        "\n",
        "| Status of Existing Checking Account | Categorical | Current bank balance | See below |\n",
        "\n",
        "| Duration | Numerical | Duration of loan in months | N/A |\n",
        "\n",
        "| Credit History | Categorical | Past repayment behavior | see below|\n",
        "\n",
        "|Purpose | categorical | Reason for loan | See below |\n",
        "\n",
        "| Credit Amount | Numerical | Loan amount requested | N/A|\n",
        "\n",
        "### Codes\n",
        "\n",
        "<details>\n",
        "<summary> Status of Existing Checking Account Codes</summary>\n",
        "\n",
        "- A11: <0 DM\n",
        "- A12: 0-199 DM\n",
        "- A13: >=200 DM or Salary >= 1 year\n",
        "- A14: No checking account\n",
        "\n",
        "</details>\n",
        "\n",
        "<details>\n",
        "<summary>Credit History Codes</summary>\n",
        "\n",
        "- A30-A32: Credits paid back duly\n",
        "- A33: delay in paying off in past\n",
        "- A34: critical account / other credits exist\n",
        "\n",
        "</details>\n",
        "\n",
        "<details>\n",
        "<summary>Purpose codes</summary>\n",
        "- A40-A46: common purposes (car, furniture, appliances, education)\n",
        "- A48-A410: others\n",
        "</details>\n",
        "\n",
        "**Note:** DM = Deutsche Mark (Germany's currency before 2002)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "### Personal Attributes - Part-1\n",
        "\n",
        "| Attribute | Type | Description | Codes |\n",
        "|-----------|------|-------------|-------|\n",
        "\n",
        "Personal Status & Sex | Categorical | Gender and marital status | See below\n",
        "\n",
        "Other Debtors/ Guarantors | Categorical | Co-applicant or guarantor | See below\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "Present Residence Since | Numerical | Years at current residence | N/A\n",
        "\n",
        "Age | Numerical | Age in years | N/A\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "### Codes\n",
        "\n",
        "<details>\n",
        "<summary>Personal Status & Sex</summary>\n",
        "\n",
        "- A91: male, divorced/separated\n",
        "- A92: female, divorced/separated/married\n",
        "- A93: male, single\n",
        "- A94: male, married/widowed\n",
        "- A95: female, single\n",
        "</details>\n",
        "\n",
        "<details>\n",
        "<summary>Other Debtors / Guarantors</summary>\n",
        "- A101: none\n",
        "- A102: co-applicant\n",
        "- A103: guarantor\n",
        "</details>\n",
        "                              \n",
        "\n",
        "### Personal Attributes - Part-2\n",
        "\n",
        "| Attribute | Type | Description | Codes |\n",
        "|-----------|------|-------------|-------|\n",
        "\n",
        "Job | Categorical | Employment type/skill level | See below\n",
        "\n",
        "Number of People Liable for Maintenance | Numerical | Number of dependents | N/A\n",
        "\n",
        "Telephone | Categorical | Telephone ownership | See below\n",
        "\n",
        "Foreign Worker | Categorical | Citizenship status | See below\n",
        "\n",
        "### Codes\n",
        "\n",
        "<details>\n",
        "<summary>Job</summary>\n",
        "- A171: unemployed/unskilled (non-resident)\n",
        "- A172: unskilled (resident)\n",
        "- A173: skilled employee\n",
        "- A174: management/highly qualified\n",
        "</details>\n",
        "\n",
        "<details>\n",
        "<summary>Telephone</summary>\n",
        "\n",
        "- A191: none\n",
        "- A192: yes (registered in applicant's name)\n",
        "</details>\n",
        "\n",
        "<details>\n",
        "<summary>Foreign Worker</summary>\n",
        "- A201: yes\n",
        "- A202: no\n",
        "</details>\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
